request.description:
Returns a single recipe by its MongoDB `_id`.

### Success response `200 OK`
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { "_id": "...", "title": "..." }
}
```

### Not found `404 Not Found`
```json
{ "success": false, "message": "Recipe not found" }
```

### Invalid ID format `400 Bad Request`
```json
{ "success": false, "message": "Invalid recipe ID" }
```

Updates one or more fields of an existing recipe by `_id`. Only send the fields you want to change. Runs schema validators on update.

### Success response `200 OK`
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Recipe updated successfully",
  "data": { "_id": "...", "title": "..." }
}
```

### Not found `404 Not Found`
```json
{ "success": false, "message": "Recipe not found" }
```

Deletes a recipe by `_id`.

### Success response `200 OK`
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Recipe deleted successfully",
  "data": {}
}
```

### Not found `404 Not Found`
```json
{ "success": false, "message": "Recipe not found" }
```
